e will be tears and laughter as you set about tearing into the cosmos together. Whatever\u2019s waiting around the next corner, you know it\u2019s going to be a blast.</p>","developers":["Eidos-Montr\u00e9al"],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-tamper","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1088850/header.jpg?t=1762805837","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2021 MARVEL. Developed by Eidos Montr\u00e9al. EIDOS and EIDOS MONTR\u00c9AL logo are registered trademarks or trademarks of the Eidos Interactive Corporation group of companies.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":78,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/marvels-guardians-of-the-galaxy?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1088850/418870/584842ab9ab4f274e8be4e46587b1d3b86223e60/1750615947/dash_av1.mpd?t=1637678512","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1088850/418870/584842ab9ab4f274e8be4e46587b1d3b86223e60/1750615947/dash_h264.mpd?t=1637678512","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1088850/418870/584842ab9ab4f274e8be4e46587b1d3b86223e60/1750615947/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1637678512","id":256861512,"name":"PEGI EN Accolades Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256861512/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1637678512"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1088850/412688/895f7b404697f16ba8f9340a8c80e4c34427f439/1750615551/dash_av1.mpd?t=1635523329","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.